{"id":"vod_lz_4358","vodId":"4358","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"妄想学生会2","name_cn":"妄想学生会2","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20220404-1/9073dfa3fbaca972b0dfc1d057c3042f.jpg"},"summary":"私立樱才学园本是一所女子高校，然而，在社会大趋势的冲击之下，校方决定打开大门，迎接男生们的到来。第一年，学校录取的男生仅有区区二十八人，他们所要面对的，是泱泱五百二十四位“如狼似虎”的女生们。津田隆利（浅沼晋太郎 配音）就是这二十八人中的一员，机缘巧合之下，他误打误撞加入了学生会之中。                                                                     　　外表端庄秀丽，却有着极大脑洞和极强妄想能力的学生会会长天草筱（日笠阳子 配音）、个性成熟可靠但有时候会语出惊人的七条天空（佐藤聪美 配音）、智商超哥但个性如同小学生一样傲娇的荻村铃（矢作纱友里 配音），在三位古灵精怪的女孩子的陪伴下，津田的校园生活正式拉开序幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-04-04 16:50:08","playable":true,"episodeCount":21,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220404/4646_573b4a62/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220404/4647_3bc34365/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220404/4648_8b330d83/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220404/4649_2c41fcd6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220404/4650_05c5afd9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220404/4651_fb505512/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220404/4652_e05159f1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220404/4653_fddc6a30/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220404/4654_0e5a95b9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220404/4655_9b5897ea/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220404/4656_dadacb5c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220404/4657_99c9fb1b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220404/4658_cb0b313f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20